{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1129288-spirit-magic-vs-changelings","id":1129288,"title":"Spirit Magic vs. Changelings.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-15T10:24:21-07:00","id":1129288,"title":"Spirit Magic vs. Changelings.","content":"I know there was a changeling supplement that talked crossover and I think there was one for werewolf but I'm drawing blanks on sources. I want to know how others have ruled the magic and gifts of the garou against changelings and other things from the Dreaming? I've already used spirit snare for example on one thinking they were possessed and it worked.<br /> <br /> Does anyone else think they can help? Either official or just how your own home games have ran.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T10:51:42-07:00","id":1129298,"title":"","content":"It shouldn't have worked, Spirit Snare affects 100% spirits not 50/50 otherwise it would affect Garou and other breed as well. Changelings are functionally the same as Possessed or the Changing Breeds. So if it doesn't work on them it shouldn't work on a Changeling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T11:35:47-07:00","id":1129322,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Derzhuzad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1129288-spirit-magic-vs-changelings?p=1129298#post1129298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It shouldn't have worked, Spirit Snare affects 100% spirits not 50/50 otherwise it would affect Garou and other breed as well. Changelings are functionally the same as Possessed or the Changing Breeds. So if it doesn't work on them it shouldn't work on a Changeling.</div> </div> </div> </div>The ST let it slide I think because in the situation the changeling had something else sticking out of it. Since then we havent dealt with changelings besides two that showed up in our camp and they dont stray far from the camp. The ST has dropped hints though along with one of the threats being a gestalt being including at least one changeling that the next chapter we are about to enter will have a few threats with fey roots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}